<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. A colour for the testimonials sections: the creator's colour
  only while their custom styling switch is on (on: true) and the colour is
  set and not transparent, otherwise the theme fallback (a colour scheme
  variable). live-testimonials.js works out the same value in the builder.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if on -%}{%- render 'scheme-color', color: color, fallback: fallback -%}{%- else -%}{{ fallback }}{%- endif -%}
</template>
